                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The clockwork dragon breathes a spray of flaming oil that deals @Damage[16d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage in a @Template[cone|distance:40] with a @Check[reflex|dc:37|basic|options:area-effect] save. Creatures that fail their saves are covered in burning oil and take @Damage[2d6[persistent,fire]|options:area-damage] damage. The clockwork dragon can't Breathe Oil again for 2 rounds.</p>"
